# Evolution: Yesterday, Today, Tomorrow

**Authors:** Mayer, William V.

## Abstract
The author reviews research on the origins of life, beginning with Thales (636 B.C.), synthesized by C. Darwin in &quot;The Origin of Species,&quot; continued by H. DeVries' mutation theory, and enhanced by the discovery in 1944 of DNA. For journal availability, see SO 505 260. (AV)

